WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:09.878
&gt;&gt; Thank you, reverend parker.

00:00:10.012 --> 00:00:13.081
And thank all of you for being

00:00:13.215 --> 00:00:14.182
here.

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:17.352
I want to thank Kamala for her

00:00:17.486 --> 00:00:20.589
not only her capacity to do what

00:00:20.722 --> 00:00:21.523
he she does, but the fire with

00:00:21.657 --> 00:00:22.758
which she brings.

00:00:22.891 --> 00:00:25.827
To all the members of congress,

00:00:25.961 --> 00:00:29.431
including representative

00:00:29.564 --> 00:00:31.900
Thompson, representative Davis

00:00:32.034 --> 00:00:34.770
and senator dick Durbin, who we

00:00:34.903 --> 00:00:38.874
wish a speedy recovery from

00:00:39.007 --> 00:00:39.341
covid.

00:00:39.474 --> 00:00:40.008
And who have long fought to

00:00:40.142 --> 00:00:41.543
honor the till family.

00:00:41.677 --> 00:00:44.646
It's not new to any of them.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:47.883
To the till family, it's an

00:00:48.016 --> 00:00:53.989
honor to be with you again.

00:00:56.091 --> 00:00:58.627
I quite frankly found myself

00:00:58.627 --> 00:01:03.231
trying to temper my anger as I

00:01:03.365 --> 00:01:03.932
was writing it.

00:01:04.066 --> 00:01:05.000
I'm not joking.

00:01:05.233 --> 00:01:09.705
I can't a fathom what it must

00:01:09.838 --> 00:01:12.140
have been like.

00:01:12.274 --> 00:01:15.510
It's hard to believe I was 12

00:01:15.644 --> 00:01:17.746
years old.

00:01:17.879 --> 00:01:19.414
And I know no matter how much

00:01:19.548 --> 00:01:23.852
time has passed, how many

00:01:23.985 --> 00:01:26.121
birthdays, how many

00:01:26.254 --> 00:01:29.558
anniversaries, it's hard to

00:01:29.691 --> 00:01:31.359
relive this.

00:01:31.493 --> 00:01:33.161
It brings it all back as if it

00:01:33.295 --> 00:01:33.695
happened yesterday.

00:01:33.829 --> 00:01:37.632
The images in your head, things

00:01:37.766 --> 00:01:38.100
you remember.

00:01:38.233 --> 00:01:40.669
But it's inspiring to see how

00:01:40.669 --> 00:01:43.371
many of your family have

00:01:43.505 --> 00:01:47.943
continued as mothers courage to

00:01:48.076 --> 00:01:55.417
find faith in pain.

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:58.687
Insisting on an open casket for

00:01:58.687 --> 00:02:02.090
her murdered, and might aim,

00:02:02.224 --> 00:02:02.858
maimed and mutilated son.

00:02:02.991 --> 00:02:04.693
14 years old.

00:02:04.793 --> 00:02:08.964
14 years old.

00:02:09.097 --> 00:02:11.299
She said, let the people see

00:02:11.433 --> 00:02:15.303
what I have seen.

00:02:15.437 --> 00:02:18.707
Let the people see what I have

00:02:18.707 --> 00:02:19.674
seen.

00:02:19.808 --> 00:02:20.008
My god.

00:02:20.142 --> 00:02:22.010
All of us who have lost children

00:02:22.144 --> 00:02:24.846
in other ways, how hard it is to

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:27.215
close the casket or keep it open

00:02:27.349 --> 00:02:29.284
or what a debate it is.

00:02:29.417 --> 00:02:36.291
To see the child that had been

00:02:36.725 --> 00:02:37.692
maimed.

00:02:37.826 --> 00:02:42.964
In a country that the world saw

00:02:43.098 --> 00:02:46.735
and his mother as a story of a

00:02:46.835 --> 00:02:49.671
family's promise and loss in the

00:02:49.805 --> 00:02:55.243
nation's reckoning with hate.

00:02:55.377 --> 00:02:55.944
Overwhelming abuse of power,

00:02:56.077 --> 00:02:58.747
brutality.

00:02:58.747 --> 00:03:01.449
It's hard to fathom.

00:03:01.583 --> 00:03:11.726
It's hard to fathom for me.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:20.268
Today on what we have been his

00:03:20.402 --> 00:03:22.204
82nd birthday, we add another

00:03:22.337 --> 00:03:22.938
chapter to the story of healing.

00:03:23.071 --> 00:03:24.973
Just as we join together when I

00:03:25.106 --> 00:03:26.775
signed the law in his name to

00:03:26.775 --> 00:03:28.777
make lynching a federal crime,

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:34.816
and think how long that took to

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:39.454
happen, we screened the movie

00:03:39.588 --> 00:03:40.088
"Till" at the white house.

00:03:40.222 --> 00:03:41.623
Today we join together as a sign

00:03:41.756 --> 00:03:43.425
a proclamation designating

00:03:43.558 --> 00:03:48.797
Emmett till national monument in

00:03:48.797 --> 00:03:49.531
both Illinois and in

00:03:49.664 --> 00:03:49.931
Mississippi.

00:03:50.065 --> 00:04:05.080
[ Applause ]

00:04:09.784 --> 00:04:11.987
&gt;&gt; We talked about wanting to do

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:19.628
this, but to support from the

00:04:19.761 --> 00:04:21.062
community has been overwhelming.

00:04:21.196 --> 00:04:23.031
I thank them for their

00:04:23.164 --> 00:04:23.431
leadership.

00:04:23.565 --> 00:04:25.200
In a time when there are those

00:04:25.333 --> 00:04:30.405
who seek to ban books, bury

00:04:30.839 --> 00:04:32.841
history, we're making it clear,

00:04:32.841 --> 00:04:42.851
crystal clear.

00:04:42.851 --> 00:04:45.987
While darkness and denialism can

00:04:46.121 --> 00:04:52.260
hide much, they erase nothing.

00:04:52.394 --> 00:04:54.195
We can't just choose to learn

00:04:54.329 --> 00:04:56.531
what we want to know.

00:04:56.865 --> 00:05:00.368
We have to learn what we should

00:05:00.502 --> 00:05:00.869
know.

00:05:00.869 --> 00:05:01.303
We should know about our

00:05:01.436 --> 00:05:01.636
country.

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:04.406
We should know everything.

00:05:04.539 --> 00:05:08.877
The good, the bad, the truth.

00:05:08.877 --> 00:05:11.646
That's what great nations do,

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:12.280
and we are a great nation.

00:05:12.414 --> 00:05:15.016
That's what they do.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:17.018
Is only with truth comes healing

00:05:17.152 --> 00:05:23.124
and another step forward towards

00:05:23.258 --> 00:05:25.393
forming a more perfect union.

00:05:25.527 --> 00:05:26.127
We have a hell of a long way to

00:05:26.261 --> 00:05:27.429
go.

00:05:27.562 --> 00:05:29.564
That's what's happening.

00:05:29.698 --> 00:05:33.768
S that's what's going to happen.

00:05:33.902 --> 00:05:34.903
To learn the history of Emmett

00:05:34.903 --> 00:05:35.904
till, through our national

00:05:36.037 --> 00:05:39.407
monument.

00:05:39.541 --> 00:05:45.347
Telling the truth in the full

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:45.981
history of our nation is

00:05:46.114 --> 00:05:46.348
important.

00:05:46.481 --> 00:05:47.315
It's important to our children,

00:05:47.449 --> 00:05:51.419
our grandchildren, our great

00:05:51.553 --> 00:05:52.153
grandchildren, to our nation as

00:05:52.287 --> 00:05:52.487
a whole.

00:05:52.921 --> 00:05:58.493
You have said it before.

00:05:58.927 --> 00:05:59.094
It's a lesson I learned.

00:05:59.227 --> 00:06:02.931
I came out of the civil rights

00:06:02.931 --> 00:06:07.369
movement as a kid, I used to say

00:06:07.502 --> 00:06:08.303
to pass something that's good,

00:06:08.436 --> 00:06:11.139
you make hate go away.

00:06:11.272 --> 00:06:12.941
Hate never goes away.

00:06:13.041 --> 00:06:14.943
It just hides.

00:06:14.943 --> 00:06:18.513
It hides under the rocks.

00:06:18.947 --> 00:06:20.515
Given a little bit of oxygen,

00:06:20.949 --> 00:06:22.050
like bad people, it comes

00:06:22.183 --> 00:06:23.485
roaring out again.

00:06:23.618 --> 00:06:29.491
It's up to all of us to deal

00:06:29.624 --> 00:06:29.858
with that.

00:06:29.991 --> 00:06:30.592
It's up to all of us to stop it.

00:06:30.959 --> 00:06:33.728
The best way to do that is with

00:06:33.862 --> 00:06:37.565
the truth.

00:06:37.699 --> 00:06:39.067
I think it applies here.

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.969
Silence is complicity.

00:06:40.969 --> 00:06:42.437
I will not be silent, nor will

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:57.152
you be silent.

00:06:57.285 --> 00:07:00.388
We have really critical work

00:07:00.522 --> 00:07:00.989
ahead.

00:07:00.989 --> 00:07:01.689
And my administration is

00:07:01.823 --> 00:07:04.993
committed to leading the path

00:07:05.126 --> 00:07:05.326
forward.

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:06.161
I know the members of congress

00:07:06.294 --> 00:07:06.995
here are even more committed

00:07:06.995 --> 00:07:07.796
than that.

00:07:07.929 --> 00:07:10.999
I'm going to close with this.

00:07:10.999 --> 00:07:15.003
The reason the world saw what

00:07:15.003 --> 00:07:17.372
Mrs. Till saw was because

00:07:17.505 --> 00:07:20.241
another hero in this story.

00:07:20.375 --> 00:07:23.511
The black press.

00:07:23.645 --> 00:07:33.688
[ Applause ]

00:07:33.822 --> 00:07:35.056
Chicago defender, other

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:35.790
newspapers and radio announcers

00:07:35.924 --> 00:07:37.992
who told the story for

00:07:38.126 --> 00:07:40.161
unflinching the bravery with

00:07:40.295 --> 00:07:41.763
which they saw the story, making

00:07:41.896 --> 00:07:47.035
sure America saw what they saw.

00:07:47.035 --> 00:07:50.271
It was once said, the way to

00:07:50.405 --> 00:07:53.308
right wrongs is to turn the

00:07:53.441 --> 00:07:54.642
light of truth upon them.

00:07:55.043 --> 00:07:55.410
The way to right wrongs is the

00:07:55.543 --> 00:07:57.946
shine the light of truth on

00:07:58.079 --> 00:07:58.246
them.

00:07:58.379 --> 00:07:59.948
That's our charge today.

00:08:00.081 --> 00:08:01.616
Did you ever think we'd be

00:08:01.749 --> 00:08:05.053
talking about banning books in

00:08:05.053 --> 00:08:05.086
America?

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:07.522
Banning history?

00:08:07.655 --> 00:08:11.292
I'm serious.

00:08:11.426 --> 00:08:13.995
The till family, to all of you

00:08:14.129 --> 00:08:17.198
here today, thank you for your

00:08:17.332 --> 00:08:18.066
courage, for never giving up,

00:08:18.199 --> 00:08:25.907
never giving up.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.176
Before I say what else is on my

00:08:28.309 --> 00:08:31.846
mind, I'm not going to leave

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:35.450
this podium.

00:08:35.583 --> 00:08:41.856
It's just barbaric.

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:43.825
Seriously, all you moms out

00:08:43.958 --> 00:08:45.126
there.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:47.095
Imagine the courage it took to

00:08:47.095 --> 00:08:50.265
say, let them see.

00:08:50.398 --> 00:08:54.102
The courage.

00:08:54.235 --> 00:08:56.471
It's now my honor to sign this

00:08:56.604 --> 00:09:01.109
proclamation in memory of Emmett

00:09:01.209 --> 00:09:03.611
till, and I thank you all for

00:09:03.745 --> 00:09:06.714
being here.

00:09:07.115 --> 00:09:09.684
I am -- I know I'm considered

00:09:09.817 --> 00:09:11.719
too much of an optimist, but I

00:09:11.853 --> 00:09:15.456
believe if we keep pushing,

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:16.191
we're going to continue to make

00:09:16.324 --> 00:09:16.558
progress.

00:09:16.691 --> 00:09:17.292
We're going to continue to make

00:09:17.425 --> 00:09:18.092
progress.

00:09:18.226 --> 00:09:21.596
It's already being made.

00:09:21.729 --> 00:09:25.400
The idea that when that

00:09:25.533 --> 00:09:29.837
14-year-old was buried, this

00:09:29.971 --> 00:09:35.410
many people of color holding

00:09:35.543 --> 00:09:37.145
powerful office, changed the

00:09:37.145 --> 00:09:37.579
direction of the count try.

00:09:37.712 --> 00:09:38.279
It would have been beyond our

00:09:38.413 --> 00:09:41.849
comprehension.

00:09:41.983 --> 00:09:57.165
And we're just getting started

00:10:06.174 --> 00:10:07.175
.

00:10:07.175 --> 00:10:11.412
&gt;&gt; President Biden is now

00:10:11.546 --> 00:10:14.282
signing a proclamation that

00:10:14.415 --> 00:10:15.183
officially makes the Emmett till

00:10:15.183 --> 00:10:16.050
national monument.

00:10:16.184 --> 00:10:21.189
It is a monument that will be in

00:10:21.189 --> 00:10:21.623
three separate locations.

00:10:21.756 --> 00:10:23.358
One will be in Mississippi near

00:10:23.491 --> 00:10:25.727
where he is believed to have

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:29.197
been murdered.

00:10:29.197 --> 00:10:33.268
The other will be at the

00:10:33.401 --> 00:10:37.205
courthouse in Mississippi, where

00:10:37.338 --> 00:10:39.207
an all-white jury acquitted

00:10:39.274 --> 00:10:39.941
till's murders.

00:10:40.074 --> 00:10:42.477
And then also back in what was

00:10:42.610 --> 00:10:45.480
his home state of Illinois,

00:10:45.613 --> 00:10:47.882
specifically in Chicago at the

00:10:48.016 --> 00:10:49.317
Roberts temple church of god.

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:51.219
That was the church where, as

00:10:51.252 --> 00:10:55.423
president Biden just referred

00:10:55.556 --> 00:10:58.293
to, his mother demanded that the

00:10:58.426 --> 00:11:00.028
funeral she was having for her

